  "affected": [
    "aws:The",
    "aws:We have identified",
    "aws:ion-java is a Java library that implements the Amazon Ion data format specification. We identified",
    "aws:Amazon awslabs.dynamodb-mcp-server is an open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that enables AI coding assistants to interact with Amazon DynamoDB, including table design, data modeling, and CDK infrastructure generation. We identified",
    "aws:log4j-cve-2021-44228-hotpatch is a tool which injects a Java agent into a running JVM process. The agent will attempt to patch the lookup() method of all loaded org.apache.logging.log4j.core.lookup.JndiLookup instances to unconditionally return the string \"Patched JndiLookup::lookup()\". It is designed to address the CVE-2021-44228 remote code execution issue in Log4j without restarting the Java process. We identified"
  ],
